#!/usr/bin/python3
"""Now Playing display for the tablet, runs on the Raspberry Pi.

Sources (priority: whatever is playing wins; otherwise the most recently paused one):
  caldera  Caldera Music on this Pi (local companion interface).
           Track info and cover art come from the Plex server.
  spotify  Spotify Connect on this Pi (librespot/Raspotify).
           librespot reports track changes via np-librespot-event to
           POST /api/librespot (accepted from localhost only).
  wiim     anything playing directly on the WiiM (radio, AirPlay,
           Spotify with the WiiM as the speaker).

When no music is playing, /api/now reports "display":"off" after OFF_DELAY seconds
(for a paused Caldera/WiiM only after PAUSE_DELAY; until then the tablet shows "Play");
the tablet app then turns the display off, and back on when music plays.

Python standard library only. The tablet talks plain HTTP to this server only;
all cover art is proxied through here (works around outdated certificates
on Android 6).
"""
